<section id="reviews" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1220px] rounded-[18px] px-4 sm:rounded-[26px] sm:px-8 md:rounded-[30px] md:px-12 py-8 sm:py-11 md:py-14 bg-subtle text-ink"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">612 GOOGLE REVIEWS · 4.9 AVERAGE</p><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">Read the one-star ones too.</h2></div><div id="elfsight-google-reviews" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[20px] border-[1.5px] border-dashed border-accent px-5 pb-[18px] pt-4 md:px-6"><p class="text-[10.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.12em] text-accent">ELFSIGHT GOOGLE REVIEWS WIDGET — LIVE EMBED · RESERVED HEIGHT 400PX · CARDS BELOW ARE THE VISUAL TARGET</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3.5 rounded-[14px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-6 pt-[22px] hidden md:flex"><p class="text-[17px] text-action">★★★★★</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-ink">Nate found the leak in twenty minutes after two other companies told me I would have to dig up the driveway. Quoted $265. Charged $265.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-[3px]"><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">Sarah K.</p><p class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-soft">Beaverton · Burst pipe · 2 weeks ago</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3.5 rounded-[14px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-6 pt-[22px] hidden md:flex"><p class="text-[17px] text-action">★★★★★</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-ink">Booked the 8–10am window, van pulled up at 8:20. New hot water unit in before lunch. The price on the website is the price I actually paid.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-[3px]"><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">Danny R.</p><p class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-soft">SE Portland · Hot water · 1 month ago</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3.5 rounded-[14px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-6 pt-[22px] "><p class="text-[17px] text-action">★★★★☆</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-ink">Four stars only because they could not come out until the next morning. Everything else was exactly as advertised, right down to the boot covers.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-[3px]"><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">Priya M.</p><p class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-soft">Lake Oswego · Blocked drain · 3 weeks ago</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
